    Z: '<path d="M0 0H30L15 10z" fill="#facc15"/><path d="M0 0V20L15 10z" fill="#000"/><path d="M0 20H30L15 10z" fill="#dc2626"/><path d="M30 0V20L15 10z" fill="#1e40af"/>',
